WEBVTT

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:19.040
Tell me who you date and I'll tell you
who you are at the Billboard Music Awards,

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:23.060
or at least who you are on the
Hot 100 of edifying gossip.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:26.840
Starting with the queen
of Planet Her, Doja Cat.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:32.240
In February 2022, Doja was on
a livestream when a man's voice

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:33.420
said in the background:

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:38.600
'Babe.' And she was quick to
say: 'Oh, gotta go, guys, bye.'

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:39.920
Boom. Live over.

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:44.880
Many suspect the voice belongs to
rapper French Montana, yes, him,

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:46.400
Khloé Kardashian's ex.

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:52.700
Speaking of the Kardashian clan, Ye has
13 Billboard nominations this year and

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:55.120
zero girlfriends to dress.

00:00:55.160 --> 00:01:00.040
He must be feeling a little lost
after a super messy divorce from

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:04.480
Kim Kardashian, a micro-romance with
a lookalike of his ex, and the brief

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:08.279
but meme-filled fling with Julia Fox,

00:01:08.319 --> 00:01:11.779
Josh Safdie's muse in Uncut Gems.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:13.360
And what about Abel, huh?

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:18.880
The Weeknd, king of nominations, fueled
plenty of fanfics when he swapped the

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:24.200
name Selena, as in Selena Quintanilla,
for Anitta in the lyrics of Party

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:25.840
Monster at Coachella.

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:28.600
And as much as we want every
kind of feat between the two,

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:32.179
right? The latest tea on Abel is that he's

00:01:33.039 --> 00:01:38.120
getting to know one of the Simi
and Haze twins better, namely Simi

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:42.179
Khadra, who just happens to be
one of Bella Hadid's best friends.

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:46.400
An Abel album is coming for our Hot 100

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:47.700
of hookups.
